# The `@keyframes` At‑Rule

```css
@keyframes slide-in {
  from {
    transform: translateX(-100%);
    opacity: 0;
  }
  to {
    transform: translateX(0);
    opacity: 1;
  }
}
```
`from` equals 0%, `to` equals 100%. You can use percentages for more steps (0%, 25%, 50%, 75%, 100%).

